# Inventory Management System

A Python GUI based Inventory Management System using:

- Python
- Tkinter
- MySQL
- ReportLab (PDF invoice)

## Features

- Add / Update / Delete Products
- Customer Management
- Transactions
- Automatic Invoice PDF generation

## Installation

1 Install dependencies

pip install -r requirements.txt

2 Run the project

python secbp.py

## Database

Create MySQL database and tables using database.sql
